# Manual test file for scrollbar-position-on-keystroke (translate/virtaal#2020).
#
# Each unit below is a long, already-translated string tall enough that
# its target textbox needs a scrollbar to see the whole thing. To check
# the bug: open a unit, scroll the TARGET box down so an interior line
# (not the first) is visible, click to place the cursor there, then type
# a single character. Expect: the view stays where you were typing.
# Bug behaviour: the scrollbar snaps back to the top on every keystroke,
# so the line you were editing scrolls out of view.
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"

